            "review_title": "Review at Napoli's Pizza Saigon",
            "review_text": "Rob D\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam35 contributions\n0\nWonderful Neighbour!\nJun 2023 • Couples\nWe moved close to hear a few weeks ago and Napoli's has become a fabulous favorite of ours. Thursday night there is a band (and singalong!). The food is always so tasty and the half and half pizza saves a few disputes.\n\nThe Gnocci is amazing. And if we are too tired they will deliver! Thank you!\nRead more\nWritten July 1, 2023\nVacation37085058945\nHey Rob, \nThanks for your nice comments. We all miss you here. We hope to see you soon again. Toni\nWritten July 11, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
