            "review_title": "Review at Napoli's Pizza Saigon",
            "review_text": "RGSCEW\nAustralia535 contributions\n0\nGreat food stop near VN Golf + Country Club\nOct 2022 • Friends\nSecond time we’ve stopped here for lunch after golf. Locals place with really tasty pizzas, cold beer and relaxing mood. \n\nIt’s our new “go to” place for food & drink after golf!!\n\nThe pizzas are really nice - and a good variety as well. \n\nGood for a group as much as for two people - check out the photos. Delicious!!\n\nNote: it is local, so don’t expect linen tablecloths but service excellent and food really good.\nRead more\nWritten October 2, 2022\nVacation37085058945\nHey,\n\nThanks for your nice comments ! \nCome again we have updated the menu !\n\nWe will be showing the rugby union World Cup in September. Go Australia !\n\nToni\nRead more\nWritten July 11, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
